 ion for a Year or More: $1000 (plus the NCBE Character and Fitness Applica
 tion fee paid directly to NCBE)\n  + Posted: January 23\, 2025\n  + JULY 2
 028 ADOPTION OF NEXTGEN BAR EXAM\n  + T\n[diff truncated]\nhttps://maineba
